AB  - This article contains highlights and a selection of the scientific advances from 
      the Clinical Assembly that were presented at the 2015 European Respiratory 
      Society International Congress in Amsterdam, the Netherlands. The most relevant 
      topics for clinicians will be discussed, covering a wide range of areas including 
      interventional pulmonology, rehabilitation and chronic care, thoracic imaging, 
      diffuse and parenchymal lung diseases, and general practice and primary care. In 
      this comprehensive review, exciting novel data will be discussed and put into 
      perspective.
