TI  - Interventional pulmonology: a new medical specialty.
PG  - 379-84
AB  - Interventional pulmonology (IP) is the newest chapter in respiratory medicine. IP 
      includes both diagnostic and therapeutic methods. Nanotechnology, in both 
      instrumental engineering and optical imaging, will further advance this 
      competitive discipline towards cell diagnosis and therapy as part of the future's 
      personalized medicine.
