AB  - ROSE (Rapid On-Site Evaluation) is an established diagnostic procedure for the 
      rapid, immediate assessment of cell material, aiming to shorten examination 
      times, avoid repeat procedures, offer patients faster treatment, and reduce 
      costs. With Van Gogh microscopy, we now have a diagnostic method that enables 
      rapid cell assessment without requiring additional specialists at the patient's 
      bedside.
