TI  - Clinical highlights from the 2016 European Respiratory Society International 
      Congress.
LID - 00147-2016 [pii]
LID - 10.1183/23120541.00147-2016 [doi]
AB  - This article contains highlights and a selection of the scientific advances from 
      the European Respiratory Society (ERS) Clinical Assembly (Assembly 1) and its six 
      respective groups (Groups 1.1-1.6) that were presented at the 2016 ERS 
      International Congress in London, UK. The most relevant topics for clinicians 
      will be discussed, covering a wide range of areas including clinical problems, 
      rehabilitation and chronic care, thoracic imaging, interventional pulmonology, 
      diffuse and parenchymal lung diseases, and general practice and primary care. In 
      this comprehensive review, the newest research and actual data will be discussed 
      and put into perspective.
