      as a key opinion leader for The Surgical Company, who have also previously 
      granted Cork University Hospital single use bronchoscopes and monitor as training 
      material. He has received speaker fees from Pentax Medical. He is the President 
      of the Irish Thoracic Society and Irish Regent of the World Association of 
      Bronchoscopy and Interventional Pulmonology. The other authors have no conflicts 
      of interest to declare.
